---
source: tests/it/install_planner.rs
expression: p.to_string()
---
Instalar app 1.1.1 (bucket main, 64bit)
  1. Instalar o lançador de comandos em C:\W\shims\.launcher\shim.exe
  2. Baixar [1] https://github.com/Azure/azure-api-management-devops-resource-kit/releases/download/1.1.1/reskit-1.1.1.zip (reskit-1.1.1.zip, sha256 11cfd076512f968bc394520942e5411d3ae25c9ac8df71139f6b02a361415dcd)
  3. Extrair [1] reskit-1.1.1.zip para C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.1.1
  4. Mover C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.1.1 para C:\W\apps\app\1.1.1
  5. Apontar C:\W\apps\app\current -> C:\W\apps\app\1.1.1 (junção)
  6. Criar comando armtemplates em C:\W\shims (armtemplates.exe + armtemplates.shim) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\armtemplates.exe
  7. Garantir C:\W\shims no PATH do usuário
  8. gravar C:\W\apps\app\1.1.1\manifest.json
  9. Registrar app 1.1.1 (main) em C:\W\state.db
